text.en:
No person shall in a complex —

(a) consume intoxicating liquor;

(b) engage in gambling;

(c) conduct himself in a riotous, disorderly, indecent or offensive manner;

(d) use language or behave in a manner that is calculated to cause a disturbance or a breach of the peace;

(e) any other activity which is against the laws of Brunei Darussalam. Small scale fishermen.
